#: aiosend._methods.create_check.CreateCheck.create_check:11
#: aiosend._methods.transfer.Transfer.transfer:12 of
msgid ""
"Cryptocurrency alphabetic code. Supported assets: “USDT”, “TON”, “BTC”, "
